    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The “Your turn, Red.” framing, cyan-to-pink attack sliders, and immediate ALLOW-versus-BLOCK reveal create a coherent red-team/blue-team demo moment across all three viewports. However, the underlying visual language remains familiar cyber-dashboard territory—dark grid, monospace labels, neon accents, bordered panels, progress bars—and the generic scrolling global header dilutes the screen’s identity, especially on tablet and mobile.",
